# games-util/steam-overlay-config -- 32-bit (abi_x86_32) libraries that the
# 32-bit Steam client and 32-bit games need, with the NVIDIA proprietary
# driver and a GNOME/Wayland+X desktop on a multilib (default/linux/amd64/23.0)
# profile. Generated with `emerge -pv --autounmask-use=y games-util/steam-launcher`
# on a stage3 (VIDEO_CARDS=nvidia, USE="elogind pulseaudio vulkan wayland X").
# If emerge asks for more, run it with --autounmask-write and merge the
# result into this file (or a new file in this directory).
